<title>USA: NYSE options seat sale - $10,000, down $5,000.</title>
<headline>NYSE options seat sale - $10,000, down $5,000.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that an options trading right seat sold for $10,000, a drop of $5,000 from the last sale on August 13, 1996.</p>
<p>The exchange said there are currently no bids outstanding for options trading right seats, while offers start at $25,000.</p>
